{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Adventurer's Guild. Today, daring adventurers come here in search of a quick fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a receptionist at the Adventurer's Guild, introduce quests to unique adventurers, and develop them into the ultimate adventurer in this training RPG!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduce quests to adventurers who come to the guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers line up at the reception desk every week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can introduce quests that meet the adventurers' needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/extras/47b0c3d720041c01067d824f9452516c.avif?t=1768622843\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meeting and parting with adventurers...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every year, new adventurers knock on the guild's door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your new teammates and work together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/extras/4a3ba12763d610648067da4776375a76.avif?t=1768622843\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers are dangerous, and someday they'll have to retire...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's send them off as they embark on their second life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A large-scale expedition for the entire guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through dungeons in cooperation with the adventurers you have trained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/extras/9f2896e1d04cd7d3f5d0d244980def3e.avif?t=1768622843\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters that appear along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/extras/dadafa67ea3ac91922054568d736f2ae.avif?t=1768622843\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your parameters and skills to become the strongest adventurer and reach the depths of the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/extras/5af23fa6f712161295827b3d7fe64a13.avif?t=1768622843\" width=614 height=346 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920810?t=1768622843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920810?t=1768622843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/45ecb982d25d8e9a680f8b7b20897f952c64a4a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768622843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920810/45ecb982d25d8e9a680f8b7b20897f952c64a4a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768622843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Adventurer's Guild. Today, daring adventurers come here in search of a quick fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a receptionist at the Adventurer's Guild, introduce quests to unique adventurers, and develop them into the ultimate adventurer in this training RPG!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduce quests to adventurers who come to the guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers line up at the reception desk every week.</p><p class=\"